sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Editor
    participant p1 as Catalog DB
    participant p2 as Outbox Stream
    participant p3 as Indexer
    participant p4 as Search Index
    participant p5 as Search API
    p0->>p1: Commit product change
    p1->>p2: Reliable change event
    p2->>p3: Consume with retry and dedup
    p3->>p4: Upsert searchable document
    p5->>p4: Search and filter
    p4->>p5: Return matching IDs
    p5->>p1: Optional authoritative details
